        "uuid": "2d7b77eb_cebf39a3",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.cc",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 642,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-11T10:50:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This adds all the globals that could be accessed for that `textureNumLevels`. For example this WGSL code will cause both textures to be added while processing the `textureNumLevels` call only once.\n\n```\n@group(0) @binding(0) var t1 : texture_2d\u003cf32\u003e;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var t2 : texture_2d\u003cf32\u003e;\n\nfn myNumLevels(t : texture_2d\u003cf32\u003e) -\u003e u32 {\n  return textureNumLevels(t);\n}\n\n@compute fn ep() {\n  let _ \u003d myNumLevels(t1) + myNumLevels(t2);\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "cedb113a_f01700a2",
      "revId": "4df5f0492ed1d66499c07c522ebf0dafccd25d4c",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
